Bundle-Name: Model Atlas Telemetry
Bundle-Description: What this Atlas holds, as OpenTelemetry metrics. It binds the Atlas \
 runtime service and turns each snapshot into a handful of gauges, reaching into nothing: \
 everything here comes from a DTO the Atlas decided to hand out. \
 \
 Optional in both directions — nothing in the Atlas requires this bundle, and this bundle \
 requires no part of the Atlas beyond the runtime service's API.

-buildpath: \
	osgi.core,\
	osgi.cmpn,\
	org.osgi.service.component.annotations,\
	org.osgi.service.metatype.annotations,\
	org.eclipse.fennec.model.atlas.runtime.info;version=snapshot,\
	org.eclipse.osgi-technology.opentelemetry.repack;version=latest

-testpath: junit-jupiter-api
